    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"> 进行攻击检定，属性检定，或豁免检定时，你可以在检定中加入一颗 d4。你能在看到d20骰值后。但该次检定的效应还没处理前再决定是否使用这一特质。你能使用此特质次数等同于 你的熟练加值 次，完成一次长休后，你重获所有已消耗的使用次数。</span></p></div></div></div><p>You can add a [[/r d4]] to one attack roll, ability check, or saving throw you make, and you can do so after seeing the [[/r d20]] roll but before the effects of the roll are resolved. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div>",
